CHAP model marketplace snapshot
===============================

upstream:       https://github.com/dhis2-chap/model-marketplace
ref:            main
commit:         b2ac5fefaae60f05ec767f4fedd36a83dc26eae1

Files in this directory are verbatim copies of the upstream YAML. build.rs
generates the table src/registry/embedded.rs compiles into the binary, which
is the last resort fallback when the registry cannot be fetched or read from
cache. There is no hand-written file list to keep in step.

Refresh with scripts/vendor-marketplace.sh and commit the result.
